WEBVTT

00:14.700 --> 00:17.500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

00:17.540 --> 00:21.380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

00:21.980 --> 00:24.420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

00:24.500 --> 00:29.140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

00:30.540 --> 00:33.220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

00:33.540 --> 00:37.500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

00:37.860 --> 00:40.780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

00:41.620 --> 00:49.300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

00:49.900 --> 00:51.380
♪Together, they are known♪

00:52.060 --> 00:56.660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

01:25.660 --> 01:31.900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

01:32.060 --> 01:34.980
[Episode 11]
[This story is purely fictional]

02:13.680 --> 02:14.660
Everyone is here.

02:15.470 --> 02:16.340
Where's Xiangu?

02:29.710 --> 02:30.130
Fifth Master!

02:31.800 --> 02:32.290
Master Zhang, he...

02:33.190 --> 02:34.610
Laogou brought Xiangu here.

02:35.150 --> 02:36.010
Let him

02:36.800 --> 02:37.780
deal with it.

02:41.800 --> 02:42.260
Master Zhang,

02:42.960 --> 02:44.850
do you think Xiangu came down here

02:45.280 --> 02:46.690
for another purpose?

02:47.590 --> 02:48.890
Laogou cares about the greater good.

02:50.710 --> 02:52.410
Now that this involves the Japanese forces,

02:53.520 --> 02:55.340
I'm sure he won't prioritize his feelings over the bigger picture.

02:56.150 --> 02:57.060
Our priority now

02:57.430 --> 02:57.980
is this place.

02:58.960 --> 02:59.940
Examine the bodies

03:00.400 --> 03:00.940
and identify the cause of death.

03:01.190 --> 03:01.540
Yes.

03:34.980 --> 03:36.660
[Yoshiyuki Hatoyama Identification Document]

03:37.150 --> 03:37.500
Master,

03:38.190 --> 03:38.890
it's Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

03:44.710 --> 03:46.340
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama died here.

03:49.080 --> 03:49.410
Master,

03:50.870 --> 03:52.060
everyone here committed seppuku.

03:56.870 --> 03:59.170
Master Zhang!

04:00.240 --> 04:01.940
Look around. Look.

04:02.960 --> 04:04.220
It's not finished yet.

04:04.910 --> 04:05.340
What do you mean?

04:06.360 --> 04:08.820
According to the rules in Fengdu,

04:09.280 --> 04:10.170
a tutelary deity shrine

04:11.020 --> 04:13.880
must contain 72 Star Mansions

04:14.360 --> 04:16.290
in accordance with

04:17.000 --> 04:18.140
its location.

04:18.630 --> 04:19.490
But look.

04:19.720 --> 04:21.050
There are only around 10 Star Mansions here.

04:22.070 --> 04:22.810
And this altar

04:23.800 --> 04:25.340
is incomplete.

04:26.800 --> 04:27.340
No ritual tools

04:27.870 --> 04:28.250
or

04:29.070 --> 04:29.980
offerings.

04:32.070 --> 04:33.050
I think

04:34.390 --> 04:35.930
something must have gone terribly wrong

04:36.510 --> 04:37.660
during construction.

04:38.160 --> 04:39.610
That's why they fled.

04:43.600 --> 04:45.370
But why did the Japanese

04:47.310 --> 04:48.810
come to an unfinished

04:48.830 --> 04:49.490
construction site?

04:50.040 --> 04:51.050
And they

04:51.720 --> 04:53.020
committed seppuku here.

04:55.310 --> 04:56.610
How weird.

05:00.630 --> 05:02.100
Be vigilant. There might be a trap here.

05:02.800 --> 05:03.810
Leave no stones

05:04.070 --> 05:04.730
unturned.

05:05.120 --> 05:05.490
Yes.

05:59.360 --> 05:59.780
Xiangu!

06:00.750 --> 06:01.140
Xiangu!

06:04.720 --> 06:05.140
Xiangu.

06:09.240 --> 06:09.610
Laogou.

06:10.680 --> 06:11.490
What are you doing here?

06:13.360 --> 06:14.540
To finish my mission.

06:15.390 --> 06:16.370
Was he already aware that the Japanese

06:16.430 --> 06:17.340
are down here?

06:18.000 --> 06:18.780
Is whatever you're doing

06:19.360 --> 06:20.580
related to them?

06:21.310 --> 06:22.050
Are you doubting me?

06:23.630 --> 06:24.290
Just answer me.

06:25.430 --> 06:26.250
What I'm doing here

06:26.360 --> 06:27.810
has nothing to do with the Japanese.

06:30.830 --> 06:31.930
What were you thinking, then?

06:33.600 --> 06:34.610
Why did you act on your own?

06:35.120 --> 06:36.050
I was so worried.

06:37.750 --> 06:39.100
I promised Ding Qiansui

06:39.510 --> 06:40.490
to explore this place for him.

06:40.600 --> 06:41.660
For that, I marked the places I've been to.

06:43.040 --> 06:43.980
But soon, I realized

06:45.360 --> 06:46.370
my marks appeared in places

06:47.040 --> 06:48.340
I've never been to.

06:48.510 --> 06:49.900
They are even in my handwriting.

06:58.060 --> 07:00.060
[Hurry Up]

07:01.310 --> 07:01.900
So,

07:02.310 --> 07:04.170
I followed the markings here.

07:06.560 --> 07:07.340
Calm down.

07:08.750 --> 07:09.610
Have you forgotten

07:10.560 --> 07:11.700
that this tower almost killed you?

07:12.560 --> 07:13.780
What you saw was an illusion

07:14.240 --> 07:15.050
trying to mislead you.

07:17.310 --> 07:17.900
Remember

07:17.900 --> 07:19.300
the hypothesis you told me?

07:21.270 --> 07:22.100
You said this tower

07:23.360 --> 07:24.930
would take away what we cared about the most.

07:26.070 --> 07:27.290
All of you ran into trouble.

07:28.720 --> 07:30.220
Zhang Qishan's men vanished.

07:30.950 --> 07:31.340
Your dogs,

07:31.800 --> 07:32.340
men,

07:32.800 --> 07:34.540
and even I died before your eyes.

07:36.000 --> 07:36.660
But I

07:39.680 --> 07:40.730
have not encountered anything yet.

07:43.240 --> 07:43.930
I was wondering

07:45.120 --> 07:46.250
if perhaps there was nothing

07:46.270 --> 07:47.250
I truly cared about.

07:50.720 --> 07:51.610
But no, I realized

07:53.720 --> 07:55.400
that the tower has played its trick on me.

07:56.680 --> 07:58.490
It took away something I care a lot about.

07:59.630 --> 08:00.250
What is it?

08:01.390 --> 08:02.220
I'll retrieve it for you.

08:04.630 --> 08:06.540
No one can retrieve what it took away.

08:08.920 --> 08:09.850
It took away my faith.

08:11.830 --> 08:13.700
But I haven't figured everything out yet.

08:14.510 --> 08:15.490
I need time.

08:19.430 --> 08:20.100
It's okay.

08:21.310 --> 08:22.050
I'll keep you company,

08:22.510 --> 08:22.810
okay?

08:24.720 --> 08:25.140
Laogou.

08:26.190 --> 08:26.970
Certain things

08:27.240 --> 08:28.650
require me to find the answers alone.

08:30.600 --> 08:31.730
Master Zhang is waiting for you out there.

08:41.120 --> 08:42.180
If this is your decision,

08:43.510 --> 08:44.530
I'll respect it.

08:46.390 --> 08:47.100
But promise me

08:48.000 --> 08:49.370
that whatever you find,

08:50.600 --> 08:51.580
you must tell me.

08:52.480 --> 08:52.940
Okay?

08:55.670 --> 08:56.130
Okay.

08:57.030 --> 08:57.770
I can tell no one

08:58.120 --> 08:59.370
but you anyway.

09:02.440 --> 09:02.940
Okay.

09:04.550 --> 09:05.340
Blow the whistle if anything.

09:06.440 --> 09:07.490
I'll be there.

09:09.960 --> 09:10.490
Don't worry.

09:18.270 --> 09:18.850
I'll be fine.

09:50.030 --> 09:50.820
Master Zhang.

09:51.790 --> 09:52.490
Fifth Master is back.

10:04.320 --> 10:05.220
Fifth Master, you're back.

10:10.910 --> 10:11.580
Where's Xiangu?

10:16.200 --> 10:16.890
I see it now.

10:17.120 --> 10:17.890
Did you two...

10:17.910 --> 10:18.700
Are you done?

10:23.630 --> 10:24.700
Did you find anything interesting?

10:28.150 --> 10:29.060
I already figured out

10:29.550 --> 10:31.420
why Yoshiyuki Hatoyama came here.

10:34.360 --> 10:35.490
After the copper meteor event,

10:36.120 --> 10:37.940
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama wrote his report.

10:39.320 --> 10:39.820
Inside,

10:40.630 --> 10:42.490
he found a peculiar mural.

10:43.630 --> 10:44.250
The mural

10:44.840 --> 10:46.770
mentioned the Yin Changsheng Mausoleum.

10:47.380 --> 10:49.700
[Letter, Beiping Japanese Chamber of Commerce]

10:51.720 --> 10:53.100
Through the Japanese Chamber of Commerce,

10:53.120 --> 10:54.220
Hatoyama solicited help from Xinyue Restaurant

10:54.720 --> 10:56.010
to inspect the mural.

10:57.080 --> 11:00.060
He was told that it was drawn by Qingwuzi.

11:01.270 --> 11:02.490
The mural contained the secret

11:02.510 --> 11:04.100
of the Yin Changsheng Palace under Changsha.

11:04.910 --> 11:05.650
And it mentioned

11:06.320 --> 11:07.300
that there was a spell

11:07.750 --> 11:08.890
allowing one to travel back

11:09.080 --> 11:10.010
in time.

11:11.030 --> 11:12.340
However, it was difficult to find the entrance,

11:13.200 --> 11:14.420
and it warned others

11:14.840 --> 11:15.490
not to find it.

11:15.490 --> 11:16.320
[Hatoyama Report]

11:16.320 --> 11:17.100
As Qingwuzi's records

11:17.630 --> 11:18.980
regarding the copper meteor proved to be accurate,

11:20.030 --> 11:21.060
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

11:21.600 --> 11:22.770
firmly believed in Qingwuzi's mural

11:23.150 --> 11:25.110
and the secret of Yin Changsheng.

11:26.210 --> 11:27.040
He was especially fascinated

11:28.000 --> 11:30.210
by the spell that could turn back time.

11:32.150 --> 11:32.700
Therefore,

11:32.700 --> 11:33.840
[Changsha]

11:33.840 --> 11:35.010
he enacted

11:35.510 --> 11:36.490
Operation Changsha.

11:37.980 --> 11:40.020
[Operation Changsha, Secret]

11:40.670 --> 11:41.420
That's odd.

11:42.550 --> 11:43.060
Master Zhang,

11:44.510 --> 11:45.980
we found Operation Catch All

11:46.000 --> 11:46.610
[Top Secret]
on the Japanese

11:46.910 --> 11:47.730
bodies.

11:48.630 --> 11:49.820
How come it becomes

11:49.840 --> 11:50.730
Operation Changsha now?

11:52.750 --> 11:53.370
Both operations

11:54.750 --> 11:55.580
must be connected somehow.

11:55.980 --> 11:58.150
[Hatoyama Report, Addendum]

11:58.150 --> 11:58.770
Hatoyama

11:59.720 --> 12:01.940
submitted the addendum of the Hatoyama Report

12:02.720 --> 12:04.370
and labelled it as top secret.

12:06.000 --> 12:06.540
Then,

12:06.840 --> 12:08.530
he launched Operation Copper Meteor

12:09.320 --> 12:10.470
while devising

12:10.790 --> 12:11.730
Operation Changsha.

12:11.730 --> 12:13.020
[Hatoyama Report]

12:14.420 --> 12:16.670
[Top Secret]

12:16.670 --> 12:17.370
Spicy?

12:18.030 --> 12:18.770
More, please.

12:23.700 --> 12:25.140
[Operation Copper Meteor]

12:25.630 --> 12:26.890
Hatoyama delegated

12:27.060 --> 12:27.790
[Cox Hendry]

12:27.790 --> 12:29.340
Operation Copper Meteor to Cox Hendry

12:29.340 --> 12:30.000
[Operation Copper Meteor]

12:30.000 --> 12:30.420
while he

12:31.240 --> 12:32.460
initiated Operation Changsha.

12:34.050 --> 12:34.840
He

12:35.390 --> 12:36.850
began his work in Changsha.

12:47.790 --> 12:48.580
Later,

12:49.030 --> 12:50.420
I busted Operation Copper Meteor.

12:51.150 --> 12:53.220
We began eliminating Japanese spies in Changsha.

12:54.510 --> 12:55.700
Japanese activity became restricted,

12:56.600 --> 12:57.100
and the spies

12:57.480 --> 12:58.730
were all killed by the Mystic Nine.

12:59.750 --> 13:02.100
[Xiangchun Gate]
But Hatoyama has entered the tower.

13:03.000 --> 13:04.220
He lived in the Otherworld Tower.

13:05.960 --> 13:06.530
But he

13:07.510 --> 13:08.890
was stuck here until now.

13:10.630 --> 13:11.490
Two years ago,

13:12.030 --> 13:13.530
Hatoyama contacted Japan

13:13.720 --> 13:14.460
one last time.

13:15.510 --> 13:16.700
According to his report,

13:17.390 --> 13:18.650
they have already found what they came to find,

13:19.510 --> 13:21.130
but something terrible happened.

13:22.000 --> 13:22.490
Since then,

13:23.000 --> 13:24.730
there have been no more updates from Hatoyama

13:25.390 --> 13:26.730
and his three elite squads.

13:27.550 --> 13:28.610
Tell them

13:30.840 --> 13:31.820
we found

13:32.870 --> 13:34.250
the place.

13:36.240 --> 13:36.700
But

13:40.080 --> 13:44.420
we might no longer be able to get out.

13:50.500 --> 13:53.900
[Household Register, Yoshiyuki Hatoyama, Missing]

13:55.550 --> 13:56.130
Master Zhang,

13:56.790 --> 13:58.130
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

13:58.960 --> 14:00.060
must have failed

14:00.360 --> 14:02.490
to find the spell to turn back time.

14:02.910 --> 14:03.940
He couldn't find a way to leave,

14:04.360 --> 14:06.300
so he committed seppuku here.

14:07.960 --> 14:09.530
He was a valuable scientist.

14:10.200 --> 14:12.070
There is no way the Japanese government would give up on him.

14:13.360 --> 14:14.940
I think they are still in Changsha.

14:15.960 --> 14:17.610
They even found the one who gave him supplies.

14:18.030 --> 14:19.460
The one who gave him supplies?

14:20.480 --> 14:21.730
Who could do that?

14:23.790 --> 14:25.980
The Mystic Nine cleared all Japanese spies.

14:27.360 --> 14:28.440
So only the Chinese

14:29.720 --> 14:31.530
who stay in Changsha can do this.

14:34.240 --> 14:35.120
For example,

14:35.750 --> 14:37.820
an influential Japanese sympathizer.

14:41.000 --> 14:41.730
Anything else?

14:47.000 --> 14:48.100
The information is in piecemeal fashion.

14:50.510 --> 14:51.580
Most of the pages we read

14:52.120 --> 14:53.100
in the journals

14:53.440 --> 14:54.100
have been torn off.

14:54.670 --> 14:55.940
Like the soldiers above,

14:56.550 --> 14:57.650
they destroyed the information

14:58.030 --> 14:59.650
on them before they died.

15:00.240 --> 15:00.770
They only kept

15:01.270 --> 15:02.300
what they allowed others to see.

15:04.030 --> 15:05.180
There must be something here

15:05.720 --> 15:06.940
that they did not want anyone to find out.

15:08.320 --> 15:09.420
That's a given.

15:10.000 --> 15:11.730
It must be the ultimate truth.

15:12.150 --> 15:13.220
But didn't you say just now

15:13.600 --> 15:14.610
that they committed seppuku because they failed

15:14.750 --> 15:15.650
to find anything useful?

15:21.270 --> 15:21.940
There is more

15:23.320 --> 15:24.370
than meets the eye.

15:25.670 --> 15:26.060
Xiaojin.

15:27.120 --> 15:28.730
Go through the journals again,

15:29.750 --> 15:30.610
especially

15:30.910 --> 15:31.940
the entry before the torn pages.

15:38.550 --> 15:39.250
Spell.

15:42.150 --> 15:42.610
Master.

15:46.150 --> 15:48.180
There are many references to spells

15:48.240 --> 15:48.940
and ponds.

15:51.400 --> 15:52.140
Ponds?

16:00.510 --> 16:02.010
There are many ponds inside.

16:03.200 --> 16:04.580
Did the Japanese mean the ponds inside?

16:07.390 --> 16:08.420
But I've checked inside.

16:09.200 --> 16:10.820
It has nothing except for caves.

16:14.240 --> 16:14.700
Come.

16:15.840 --> 16:16.850
Let's go inside again.

16:42.960 --> 16:44.300
The one in this photo

16:44.960 --> 16:46.980
looks like the Otherworld Patriarch.

16:47.270 --> 16:47.730
Look.

17:08.060 --> 17:12.740
[Precise Divination]

17:13.880 --> 17:15.050
The Otherworld Patriarch?

17:16.440 --> 17:17.530
But it's different from the one you saw

17:17.550 --> 17:18.330
in Liunian Hall.

17:25.160 --> 17:25.640
Come.

17:25.750 --> 17:26.380
Translate it now.

17:29.070 --> 17:30.180
The Japanese said

17:30.920 --> 17:32.330
that after they entered the Otherworld Tower,

17:32.720 --> 17:34.010
they found a statue with hair

17:34.350 --> 17:35.700
at the corner by the main passage.

17:36.960 --> 17:38.140
The statue was 1.7m tall,

17:38.830 --> 17:39.700
and looked like a real person.

17:40.160 --> 17:41.980
Its hair was dark, smooth,

17:42.310 --> 17:43.180
and glossy.

17:44.070 --> 17:44.940
It was estimated

17:45.240 --> 17:46.900
that the hair belonged to a woman

17:47.270 --> 17:48.180
of 18 to 25 years old.

17:49.000 --> 17:50.620
The hair was well-preserved and not wilted.

17:51.400 --> 17:52.140
It was believed

17:52.640 --> 17:53.800
that the statue with hair

17:53.960 --> 17:55.770
was made with unique ritual craftsmanship.

17:57.750 --> 17:58.530
And eerily,

17:59.400 --> 18:00.140
when they touched it,

18:01.000 --> 18:02.730
the statue crumbled into dust.

18:03.510 --> 18:04.620
Only a bundle of hair remained.

18:05.830 --> 18:07.810
They kept it so that they could study it

18:08.350 --> 18:09.730
when they returned.

18:13.590 --> 18:14.490
In that case,

18:15.510 --> 18:16.570
this is not

18:16.590 --> 18:18.660
the Otherworld Patriarch we saw

18:19.680 --> 18:20.770
in Liunian Hall.

18:23.310 --> 18:23.940
Anyway, Eighth Master,

18:24.510 --> 18:25.570
the Japanese probably

18:25.680 --> 18:26.420
placed it here

18:26.830 --> 18:27.570
as a red herring

18:27.720 --> 18:28.290
to mislead us.

18:36.200 --> 18:36.860
Right.

18:54.790 --> 18:55.980
The water and air

18:56.350 --> 18:57.250
are stagnant here.

18:58.030 --> 19:01.050
By right, it is a dead end.

19:06.030 --> 19:06.620
Where is Xiangu?

19:09.070 --> 19:10.240
She's exploring inside.

19:11.830 --> 19:12.250
Master Zhang,

19:15.030 --> 19:16.180
I brought Xiangu here.

19:17.240 --> 19:18.140
No matter what she does,

19:18.440 --> 19:19.530
I hope you won't make it difficult for her.

19:21.240 --> 19:22.860
I'll bear full responsibility.

19:23.550 --> 19:24.470
I'll question her

19:25.270 --> 19:26.140
once we're out.

19:33.920 --> 19:34.860
This is

19:35.960 --> 19:36.940
a natural pond.

19:38.200 --> 19:39.940
The Japanese must have come here as well.

19:41.200 --> 19:42.270
But after they got out,

19:42.830 --> 19:44.530
they committed seppuku.

19:45.640 --> 19:47.490
What exactly happened here?

19:48.680 --> 19:50.770
We came here by using a spell.

19:51.640 --> 19:52.810
So did the Japanese.

19:54.270 --> 19:55.530
According to the mural,

19:57.440 --> 19:58.380
there are two other spells.

20:01.160 --> 20:01.570
Master Zhang,

20:03.110 --> 20:04.660
I've been hiding something from you.

20:06.000 --> 20:06.810
After we split,

20:07.680 --> 20:09.220
the tower made me perform two spells.

20:10.400 --> 20:11.700
I have already performed

20:13.550 --> 20:14.770
all three spells on the mural.

20:18.270 --> 20:19.490
After I performed the second spell,

20:20.440 --> 20:21.570
I noticed that something was off.

20:22.640 --> 20:23.620
But I had to save lives,

20:23.640 --> 20:24.330
so I paid it no mind.

20:25.070 --> 20:26.140
Besides, I also wanted to find out

20:27.070 --> 20:29.010
what would happen after I performed all three spells.

20:30.350 --> 20:31.640
So I played along.

20:31.830 --> 20:32.550
I see it now.

20:32.590 --> 20:33.730
I pretended to be controlled by the tower.

20:34.400 --> 20:35.380
When I tried to kill you previously,

20:36.440 --> 20:37.810
it was all an act for this tower.

20:39.200 --> 20:40.420
I want to deceive this creature.

20:41.000 --> 20:41.570
No.

20:42.830 --> 20:43.660
A creature

20:44.350 --> 20:45.700
would never come up with a scheme like this.

20:46.640 --> 20:47.700
You're right, Master Zhang.

20:49.510 --> 20:49.980
Only the Japanese

20:51.510 --> 20:52.290
could come up with it.

20:53.550 --> 20:54.810
It has always struck me as odd.

20:56.030 --> 20:57.180
After I came down,

20:58.200 --> 20:58.900
I never

20:58.920 --> 21:00.490
found anything about the Japanese.

21:01.480 --> 21:02.330
But suddenly,

21:03.510 --> 21:04.700
everything about the Japanese

21:05.310 --> 21:06.360
suddenly appeared

21:07.070 --> 21:08.010
before us.

21:10.830 --> 21:11.860
Knowing them,

21:13.590 --> 21:14.250
they could've

21:14.270 --> 21:15.900
burned all the evidence here.

21:17.750 --> 21:19.010
Yet they kept the journals.

21:20.110 --> 21:21.090
And the journals

21:21.880 --> 21:23.460
mentioned the ponds many times.

21:24.400 --> 21:24.980
However,

21:26.270 --> 21:27.980
I do not see any traces of the Japanese here.

21:29.200 --> 21:30.940
They erased all traces here on purpose.

21:31.400 --> 21:32.940
And that's their real plan.

21:34.400 --> 21:36.050
They wanted to lure us here.

22:00.780 --> 22:02.740
[The Hope of Victory]

22:08.750 --> 22:09.490
What does this mean?

22:10.510 --> 22:11.490
The hope of victory.

22:12.750 --> 22:13.940
The hope of victory?

22:14.940 --> 22:16.420
[The Hope of Victory]

22:42.790 --> 22:44.010
Time is turning back.

23:09.110 --> 23:10.900
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama!

24:44.550 --> 24:45.090
Fire!

24:48.680 --> 24:49.220
No more bullets?

25:41.640 --> 25:42.570
Stay vigilant.

25:43.550 --> 25:44.700
See if they are dead or alive.

26:03.550 --> 26:04.420
Master Zhang.

26:16.110 --> 26:17.050
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

26:23.310 --> 26:24.220
Thank you so much.

26:26.920 --> 26:27.940
The same?

26:28.590 --> 26:30.530
This is Resurrection.

26:31.440 --> 26:32.420
Coming back alive?

26:32.880 --> 26:35.090
You have no idea the miracles

26:35.270 --> 26:36.830
this place holds.

26:37.680 --> 26:38.530
It's a spell, right?

26:40.590 --> 26:42.250
You can call it a spell.

26:43.030 --> 26:44.290
Or you can call it

26:45.400 --> 26:47.490
the ancient Chinese wisdom.

26:48.750 --> 26:51.530
This tower is a priceless jewel

26:51.550 --> 26:53.010
left by your ancestors.

26:54.480 --> 26:56.200
It's a shame. The Chinese now

26:56.790 --> 26:57.620
don't deserve it.

27:00.310 --> 27:01.700
So, everything here

27:02.960 --> 27:03.980
is set up by you.

27:07.240 --> 27:08.010
At first,

27:08.750 --> 27:09.490
we thought

27:09.510 --> 27:11.570
we had you under control.

27:12.590 --> 27:14.700
So, we launched the second phase of our plan.

27:15.590 --> 27:16.330
To our surprise,

27:17.240 --> 27:18.570
you were just acting.

27:21.640 --> 27:22.420
That's okay.

27:22.720 --> 27:23.980
This is enough for us.

27:25.350 --> 27:28.140
What you know is just the tip of the iceberg

27:28.670 --> 27:31.790
of the secret of Yin Changsheng and the Otherworld Patriarch!

27:32.200 --> 27:34.220
Their power is science!

27:36.680 --> 27:37.800
But you're too foolish

27:38.110 --> 27:39.660
to understand.

27:41.960 --> 27:42.980
I'm different.

27:43.920 --> 27:46.050
I spent three years studying this place.

27:46.510 --> 27:48.810
I have mastered the secret of the otherworld.

28:27.880 --> 28:29.420
The operation begins now.

28:37.350 --> 28:38.330
Good.

28:39.240 --> 28:40.220
Operation Catch All

28:40.830 --> 28:42.180
will conclude soon.

28:42.400 --> 28:43.420
Operation Catch All.

28:45.720 --> 28:46.570
Operation Catch Dog.

28:50.680 --> 28:51.660
Your target

28:52.240 --> 28:52.940
is me.

28:55.790 --> 28:56.290
Laogou!

28:57.400 --> 28:57.900
Master Zhang.

28:58.240 --> 28:58.940
Take Xiangu with you.

28:59.830 --> 29:00.700
Thank you, everyone.

29:07.480 --> 29:07.980
Laogou.

29:08.640 --> 29:09.140
Laogou.

29:11.400 --> 29:11.900
Laogou.

29:12.720 --> 29:13.220
Laogou.

29:15.270 --> 29:16.030
Laogou!

29:31.240 --> 29:32.330
Where are the Japanese bodies?

29:34.750 --> 29:35.900
This place is creepy.

29:36.830 --> 29:37.700
Stay vigilant.

29:55.750 --> 29:56.660
It's Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

29:57.070 --> 29:58.140
He wants to seal this place with bombs

29:58.550 --> 29:59.330
and bury us alive.

30:06.070 --> 30:06.600
Master Zhang.

30:07.270 --> 30:07.980
I don't see anyone inside.

30:09.960 --> 30:10.570
Where did the Japanese

30:10.960 --> 30:12.380
take Laogou to?

30:14.000 --> 30:14.770
This place will collapse soon.

30:15.400 --> 30:16.050
Let's get out first.

30:16.590 --> 30:17.290
I know an exit.

30:17.640 --> 30:18.180
Come with me.

30:26.110 --> 30:26.660
Master Zhang.

30:28.240 --> 30:28.620
Master Zhang.

30:29.000 --> 30:29.490
Where's Fifth Master?

30:29.920 --> 30:31.010
The Japanese took him away.

30:32.830 --> 30:33.490
Let's run.

30:34.510 --> 30:35.380
This place will collapse soon.

30:37.600 --> 30:38.240
What are you doing?

30:38.550 --> 30:39.330
Fifth Master is inside.

30:39.340 --> 30:40.620
- I have to save him.
- We can only find him

30:41.030 --> 30:41.980
if we're alive. Come.

30:42.240 --> 30:43.090
- Master is still inside! - Come.

30:43.110 --> 30:43.860
- Stop it. - Master!

30:43.880 --> 30:44.660
Master is still inside.

30:44.920 --> 30:45.730
- Run. - Master Zhang!

30:58.080 --> 30:58.700
Quick.

31:05.750 --> 31:06.250
Juanlian.

31:06.720 --> 31:07.330
Where is Master?

31:09.550 --> 31:10.050
Master Zhang.

31:10.960 --> 31:12.140
Fifth Master is missing.

31:12.960 --> 31:13.940
What should we do now?

31:25.680 --> 31:26.940
Fifth Master has been kidnapped by the Japanese.

31:27.680 --> 31:29.290
It seems like their goal of luring us down

31:29.640 --> 31:30.570
is to capture Fifth Master.

31:32.750 --> 31:34.490
They set up everything

31:34.880 --> 31:35.770
for him.

31:36.310 --> 31:37.330
Master is missing.

31:37.720 --> 31:38.220
So we...

31:41.640 --> 31:42.980
The Japanese went out of their way to capture him.

31:43.440 --> 31:44.490
That means he is useful to them.

31:44.920 --> 31:45.860
He will be safe for now.

31:46.680 --> 31:47.330
Let's turn back.

31:47.590 --> 31:48.420
I'll find a way to find him.

31:49.480 --> 31:50.050
Guys!

31:50.830 --> 31:52.700
Gather all our clan's informants in Changsha City.

31:53.000 --> 31:54.570
We'll turn the whole city upside down to find Master if we must.

31:54.590 --> 31:55.050
Yes!

31:55.200 --> 31:55.940
Tell the Patrol Camp

31:56.310 --> 31:57.460
to let the Wus through if they see them

31:57.640 --> 31:58.900
searching with their dogs.

31:59.310 --> 31:59.660
Yes!

32:08.830 --> 32:10.330
Put up a wanted notice for Yoshiyuki Hatoyama.

32:11.350 --> 32:12.090
Then, put up another notice

32:13.030 --> 32:13.620
to collect

32:14.270 --> 32:15.980
any information regarding the Otherworld Patriarch.

32:17.000 --> 32:17.380
Yes!

32:19.350 --> 32:20.250
The event in the Otherworld Tower

32:20.440 --> 32:21.250
shook the Mystic Nine.

32:21.640 --> 32:23.330
Fifth Master is still missing.

32:23.550 --> 32:25.570
The true goal of the Japanese continues to puzzle everyone.

32:26.110 --> 32:27.900
Master Zhang knows Yoshiyuki Hatoyama's plan

32:27.920 --> 32:28.700
is still ongoing.

32:29.030 --> 32:30.140
The key

32:30.510 --> 32:31.980
lies in Wu Laogou.

32:32.510 --> 32:34.250
Unbeknownst to Zhang Qishan,

32:34.550 --> 32:36.010
after everyone left the Otherworld Tower,

32:36.510 --> 32:37.350
[Peace and Serenity]
they all

32:37.590 --> 32:38.490
have a secret.

32:38.790 --> 32:40.220
[Huo's Residence]
Everyone, listen to me now.

32:40.550 --> 32:41.730
We will find Wu Laogou immediately.

32:41.960 --> 32:43.250
[Shushen Hall]
Depart now!

32:43.550 --> 32:44.050
Quick!

32:59.240 --> 32:59.860
I see it now.

33:07.460 --> 33:09.020
[Huo Yuqin]

33:09.460 --> 33:10.820
[Huo Yuyao]

33:13.920 --> 33:14.730
You're saying

33:17.110 --> 33:18.090
that I'm only a leader in name,

33:18.110 --> 33:19.050
not in substance.

33:19.270 --> 33:20.940
Work for Ding Qiansui yourself then.

33:21.680 --> 33:23.660
I understand that you're eager to save Wu Laogou.

33:24.790 --> 33:27.180
But our clan has another priority,

33:27.790 --> 33:29.380
and that is to please Ding Qiansui.

33:30.920 --> 33:32.220
That way, the people you care about

33:32.830 --> 33:34.010
will be safe.

33:34.440 --> 33:35.770
You're using me.

33:38.830 --> 33:39.900
Using you?

33:41.960 --> 33:42.530
Nian,

33:43.680 --> 33:45.380
if you were in my position,

33:46.550 --> 33:47.700
you would have done

33:47.720 --> 33:48.860
the same thing.

33:51.750 --> 33:52.700
Have you done

33:52.880 --> 33:54.250
what Ding Qiansui asked you to do?

33:55.720 --> 33:56.570
Don't tell me

33:57.480 --> 33:59.140
you returned empty-handed?

34:02.200 --> 34:03.250
You're the most skillful member

34:03.270 --> 34:04.770
of our clan.

34:05.920 --> 34:06.940
Surely, you got it?

34:58.760 --> 35:00.090
Ding Qiansui is colluding with the Japanese.

35:01.190 --> 35:02.740
The jar is the key to the spell.

35:03.440 --> 35:04.780
It will bring danger to your life.

36:29.800 --> 36:31.020
Missing person?

36:32.750 --> 36:33.730
Isn't that Fifth Master?

36:34.200 --> 36:35.340
How come he went missing?

36:36.070 --> 36:36.970
That's impossible.

36:37.310 --> 36:39.070
Several days ago, I heard that he was working

36:39.070 --> 36:39.940
with Master Zhang.

36:41.110 --> 36:41.780
Who is that?

36:42.320 --> 36:44.260
If you see the man on this poster,

36:44.280 --> 36:45.260
contact us right away.

36:45.710 --> 36:47.380
Those who come forward with useful information

36:47.510 --> 36:48.860
will be rewarded 1,000 silver coins.

36:49.710 --> 36:50.320
1,000?

36:50.320 --> 36:50.940
1,000.

36:50.960 --> 36:52.740
If you hide information, you'll be deemed as an accomplice

36:53.030 --> 36:54.260
and will be punished equally.

36:54.400 --> 36:54.860
This is...

36:55.670 --> 36:56.690
What does the disappearance of Fifth Master

36:56.760 --> 36:58.380
have anything to do with this Japanese?

36:58.380 --> 36:59.510
[Missing Person]

36:59.510 --> 37:00.940
How would I know?

37:13.920 --> 37:14.340
Master,

37:15.000 --> 37:15.980
the order has been issued.

37:16.110 --> 37:17.940
All 36 checkpoints in the city have been set up

37:18.320 --> 37:19.420
to search for Fifth Master.

37:19.920 --> 37:21.790
We will search every corner.

37:22.800 --> 37:23.820
We have also put up the bounty

37:24.280 --> 37:25.260
to mobilize all citizens

37:25.920 --> 37:27.050
to collect information about Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

37:27.630 --> 37:28.860
and the Otherworld Patriarch.

37:33.230 --> 37:34.090
The Otherworld Patriarch

37:35.150 --> 37:36.210
expended a lot back then

37:37.590 --> 37:39.820
to build a tower underneath Changsha.

37:41.030 --> 37:42.170
He must have left some traces behind.

37:44.190 --> 37:45.130
As for Hatoyama,

37:46.590 --> 37:47.860
he must have come up with a thorough plan

37:49.150 --> 37:50.650
before he lured us down there.

37:53.190 --> 37:54.490
A sly fox has many hideouts.

37:55.230 --> 37:56.010
Capturing him

37:57.280 --> 37:58.210
won't be easy.

37:59.590 --> 38:00.300
What should we do now then?

38:01.000 --> 38:02.130
No one knows the underground of Changsha

38:03.550 --> 38:05.170
better than the Mystic Nine does.

38:11.630 --> 38:12.380
Have you

38:12.920 --> 38:13.650
notified all of them?

38:14.400 --> 38:15.090
Yes.

38:16.070 --> 38:16.980
Is Second Master back?

38:18.000 --> 38:18.780
He is in Changsha as we speak.

38:21.280 --> 38:21.980
But...

38:24.510 --> 38:26.340
Ninth Master is still being imprisoned by Huo Wenhai.

38:27.480 --> 38:28.260
He probably can't escape.

38:29.590 --> 38:30.490
If he can't escape,

38:31.590 --> 38:32.490
we'll just have to break in.

38:36.630 --> 38:37.460
Gather the Mystic Nine.

38:38.230 --> 38:40.380
We'll have a meeting at Xie Residence an hour later.

38:41.070 --> 38:41.420
Yes.

38:42.580 --> 38:45.580
[Xie's Residence]

38:45.580 --> 38:48.420
[Confession Letter]

38:58.320 --> 38:59.210
Xie Jiu,

39:00.030 --> 39:01.530
you have no idea

39:01.550 --> 39:03.860
how much I did to cover you.

39:05.000 --> 39:06.570
Colluding with the Japanese is a serious crime.

39:07.360 --> 39:08.610
If I hadn't suppressed the news,

39:09.000 --> 39:09.950
the Ministry of War

39:09.950 --> 39:11.640
would have dug out many ugly things.

39:12.230 --> 39:14.780
Can't you see what I'm doing for you here?

39:26.880 --> 39:27.600
Sign it.

39:28.110 --> 39:29.940
If you can tell me who you helped,

39:31.480 --> 39:32.740
I'll talk to them

39:33.670 --> 39:34.690
so you and your clan will be safe.

39:35.230 --> 39:36.980
I'm a man of my own word.

39:50.510 --> 39:51.170
Xie Jiu.

40:00.590 --> 40:01.610
Listen.

40:01.630 --> 40:03.650
Playing deaf will not make the whole thing go away.

40:04.280 --> 40:06.090
You're pretty much convicted of sedition right now.

40:07.480 --> 40:08.380
Sign it

40:08.960 --> 40:10.530
and you might still have a clan.

40:10.800 --> 40:12.010
If you don't sign it,

40:13.150 --> 40:15.820
I'll make sure you're there to watch your clan fall apart.

40:20.030 --> 40:21.780
Who says you can come in? Bugger off!

40:25.440 --> 40:27.380
Officer Huo, did you wake up on the wrong side of the bed?

40:29.150 --> 40:30.050
You're grumpy.

40:40.150 --> 40:41.260
What are you doing here?

40:41.630 --> 40:42.380
We're having a meeting.

40:43.150 --> 40:43.490
Leave.

40:49.670 --> 40:50.530
Fellow masters,

40:50.920 --> 40:52.570
Xie Residence has been appropriated by the military

40:52.840 --> 40:53.420
for official business.

40:54.070 --> 40:55.980
I ask for your sincere cooperation, instead of

40:56.230 --> 40:57.130
making this tough for me.

40:57.840 --> 40:59.170
Did the Huo Clan change their rules or something?

40:59.590 --> 41:00.900
It's run by a man now?

41:05.030 --> 41:06.740
Officer Huo, pardon us.

41:07.000 --> 41:09.170
You must be here to attend the meeting on behalf of the Huo Clan.

41:10.480 --> 41:12.490
But the ancestral rule in the Huo Clan dictates

41:13.360 --> 41:14.610
that only women can run the clan.

41:18.400 --> 41:19.650
Have you...

41:19.760 --> 41:20.490
Insolence!

41:21.840 --> 41:22.780
Xie Jiu colludes with the Japanese.

41:23.110 --> 41:24.010
The military is investigating it.

41:24.510 --> 41:25.740
You're trespassing.

41:25.760 --> 41:26.740
Is this a rebellion?

41:27.070 --> 41:28.490
Guards, arrest them!

41:35.440 --> 41:36.010
Guards!

41:51.760 --> 41:52.900
So much talking.

41:53.630 --> 41:54.210
How noisy.

41:56.150 --> 41:57.130
Aren't we here for a meeting?

41:57.760 --> 41:58.530
Where's Zhang Qishan?

42:05.280 --> 42:05.690
Master Zhang.

42:25.670 --> 42:27.300
Everyone, please take a seat.

42:44.500 --> 42:48.660
♪The past fades like smoke♪

42:49.020 --> 42:51.740
♪A choice is made in silence♪

42:52.020 --> 42:54.820
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

42:55.220 --> 42:58.980
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

42:59.220 --> 43:02.660
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

43:02.940 --> 43:06.340
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

43:06.420 --> 43:13.700
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

43:14.140 --> 43:17.420
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

43:17.700 --> 43:20.940
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

43:21.100 --> 43:25.140
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

43:25.340 --> 43:28.700
♪Who believes in fate?♪

43:28.940 --> 43:32.300
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

43:32.540 --> 43:35.820
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

43:36.140 --> 43:39.820
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

43:40.020 --> 43:43.260
♪Take care♪

43:43.260 --> 43:45.820
♪We once raced♪

43:45.900 --> 43:47.820
♪For the dawn♪

43:47.980 --> 43:51.260
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

43:51.380 --> 43:54.660
♪In the web of fate♪

43:54.660 --> 43:57.860
♪No one can escape♪

43:58.860 --> 44:00.700
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

44:00.860 --> 44:02.420
♪We too were young once♪

44:02.500 --> 44:05.940
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

44:06.140 --> 44:08.460
♪Keep the ember lit♪

44:08.580 --> 44:13.100
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

44:13.220 --> 44:16.180
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

44:16.420 --> 44:19.940
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

44:20.060 --> 44:23.820
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

44:24.140 --> 44:27.620
♪Who believes in fate?♪

44:27.780 --> 44:30.780
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

44:31.020 --> 44:34.780
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

44:34.940 --> 44:38.660
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

44:38.780 --> 44:50.220
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪
